{"reviews":[{"id":"B018681Q64-0","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"This is a go to in my salon for my pink and white work. It\u2019s non yellowing. High shine and nearly indestructible, of course you\u2019ll always have that one client that\u2019s using their nails as a carpentry tool!! \ud83e\udee3 You know who you are!","h":9,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-1","r":4.0,"t":"Good.","x":"This top coat is good if you use it for acrylic nails. If you only do gel polish and use this as top coat it will crack a day or two later making your nails look terrible. I do love using it for acrylic nails it holds up well as long as you cap the ends the colored nail polish doesn\u2019t peel or crack.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B018681Q64-2","r":5.0,"t":"Licensed Professional review!","x":"This is my go to gel top coat of 4yrs! Seals everything perfectly gel, designs, glitter ect in 1 coat. My clients nails have a lasting shine that proves durable even after 2 to 3 weeks! Just buy it already!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great for thin nails","x":"My thin nails are insanely durable with this top coat. Been using it for a few years and haven\u2019t found anything that works as well.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-4","r":5.0,"t":"Favorite topcoat","x":"This is my favorite topcoat it\u2019s perfect I don\u2019t even have to wipe it off it does a job every time","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-5","r":1.0,"t":"It cures, even when you\u2019re not near the sun","x":"Awful Awful, because it gets hard, even when you\u2019re not in sunlight! It\u2019s terrible ! cures, even when you\u2019re not near the sun\ud83e\udd26\ud83c\udffe\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\ude44 I made the mistake of using this when my blinds were pulled up high, and the sun was beaming through my window. That was the first time. Because it was my fault, I decided to give this product another try, and I purchased another bottle. Learning my lesson, I used it in cool places, not near heat. Let\u2019s just say that that did not help, as it still cured, even when n","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B018681Q64-6","r":1.0,"t":"Horrible polish","x":"This is my first time using a gel top coat at home that needed to be cured under an LED light. I put this top coat on yesterday and it has already chipped off completely on several nails and I've had to reapply it at least four times. It develops an air pocket underneath the Polish and then it lifts and chips. I will be returning this it is the most horrible polish.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-7","r":5.0,"t":"Close to professional","x":"I have been doing nails at home for 20 years. And have used everything from professional products, to crap off the store shelves. This product is as close to professional as it gets. Some of my clients are extremely hard on their nails. And some of my clients work with multiple chemicals. And this product stands up to both.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-8","r":5.0,"t":"Nice product!!","x":"This product is a real seal for your nails if you broke one. But you have to cut them a little so the crack don\u2019t be doing a lot of movement. To prevent that broke easily. Until it grow out of your nail bed. It manage easily and last a lot.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-9","r":5.0,"t":"The best top coat","x":"Ive purchased this polish multiple times. It's the best no wipe top coat! Super shiny and works great even over regular polish! Make my nails sturdy too!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-10","r":5.0,"t":"The best top coat","x":"Ive purchased this polish multiple times. It's the best no wipe top coat! Super shiny and works great even over regular polish! Make my nails sturdy too!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great topcoat","x":"This is one of my go-to gel topcoats. Highly recommend. My nails down get scratched and they are left really shiny.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-12","r":5.0,"t":"Nails last 3-4 weeks !","x":"I love that it made my nails last longer than they usually do and also adds extra protection for my nails .","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-13","r":5.0,"t":"Top coat","x":"I use this top coat for my press-on nails and I absolutely love this product it\u2019s a game changer!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2023"},{"id":"B018681Q64-14","r":5.0,"t":"Satisfied","x":"Product arrived promptly and works well with companion products.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B018681Q64-15","r":5.0,"t":"A must have for complete nails","x":"Would never call my nails complete without this last step","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B018681Q64-16","r":5.0,"t":"THE BEST TOP COAT!!!","x":"The BEST top coat hands down!! And absolutely no wipe!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B018681Q64-17","r":1.0,"t":"DO NOT BUY","x":"I wish I can literally give it a 0 star rating. I got it and was so ready to use it on a client but sadly I looked like a fool because I opened it and the gel was harden I couldn\u2019t get the brush out at all!! The top coat was dried up around the tubing entrance. I wasted my money just for this ?! Ridiculous and the fact I can\u2019t even return it or get a refund is ridiculous as well. I just want my money back or a new one. Ill post a picture of it tomorrow morning. But do NOT BUY THIS. !!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B018681Q64-18","r":5.0,"t":"Theee it girl topcoat!!","x":"[[VIDEOID:e70d7bcba112e46065408757f0917bf2]] Y\u2019all but about three of these at once cause that\u2019s how much your gonna love this and how much your gonna use it!!! It\u2019s top tier for everythinggggg!!! The shine is perfect the seal is incredible and it\u2019s non yellowing!! Well so far in my research..lol y\u2019all get this!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B018681Q64-19","r":5.0,"t":"I love this gel top coat!","x":"This is my favorite gel topcoat. Good quality at a good price I commonly see this priced for about $15 a bottle I ordered mine for nine dollars. It\u2019s super shiny and durable, I really like that it\u2019s non-wipe Which makes application nice and easy,  My item came fully intact. I highly recommend this topcoat.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B018681Q64-20","r":5.0,"t":"Best out there","x":"I love LOVE this product.  It is thicker than the regular UV top coats and it seals so perfectly!  I won't get anything else.  But, I do suggest you shop around before spending the outrageous price of $15 on here!  I got my \"3\" bottles for less than $8!  I recommend this product!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B018681Q64-21","r":5.0,"t":"This is my #1 top coat","x":"Every since I started using this polish I fell in love with it. I did use  other top coats some  pricey top coats and some other cheap top coats, but none of them dry as beautiful and as shinny as this one. As of right now this one will be my forever top coat to use.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B018681Q64-22","r":2.0,"t":"Does not level well","x":"No matter how well I applied this, I always had a few nails that looked and felt uneven after I used this, which is not typical for a gel top coat. I really like this brand and was surpised that the self leveling was so poor.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B018681Q64-23","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"I use this brand (gel) to fill in my nails and if you do not use color polish, the sealer gives a great natural shiny appearance. I like the way my nails look when I use the coating.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B018681Q64-24","r":5.0,"t":"Used this for years as a pro","x":"Professional beautician used over acrylic to seal, acrylic is porous not sealing it could lead to bacteria. Not good for natural nails nor over regular polish","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise its high shine and durability, with many calling it their go-to top coat.","cites":[1,3,4,5,10,11,12]},{"text":"Many users report long-lasting results, with nails staying shiny and intact for weeks.","cites":[3,9,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers note it works well over acrylics and regular polish and makes nails sturdy.","cites":[2,10,11]},{"text":"A few negative reviews report chipping, lifting, or cracking, especially with gel polish or at-home use.","cites":[2,7]},{"text":"One reviewer complains that it cures even without direct sunlight, which they found problematic.","cites":[6]}]},"qa":[]}